B.ae8=new A.d6("Betting, Lotteries and Gaming Act (Cap 131, BCLB):","Cap 131 regulates uncertain-outcome betting and games of chance. Direct peer-to-peer skill esports contests without house odds\u2014where participant stakes fund fixed-fee prize pools\u2014alongside risk-free Demo PTS mode are structured under the pure-skill exemption rationale.",B.bU,null)
