B.aee=new A.d6("Practice Demo Coins (PTS):","Complimentary tokens strictly for skill rehearsal. Demo PTS hold zero cash value and cannot be exchanged, sold, or withdrawn.",B.t,null)
B.adT=new A.d6("Contest Escrow & Tiered Service Fees:","When both players confirm Ready, stakes lock in segregated escrow. Verified winners receive prize pools less published arena facilitation fees (1v1 Duels: 15% under $10 / 12.5% $10+; 5-Player Blitz Pods: 16%\u201322% by Division tier; Tournaments: 15%\u201320%). Third-party payment processor deposit/withdrawal fees are calculated transparently upfront before payment approval.",B.t,null)
B.adS=new A.d6("AML 1x Competitive Play-Through Invariant:","To deter payment fraud and money laundering, deposited cash funds must be staked at least once (1x) in completed skill matches before withdrawal eligibility. Match winnings are withdrawable immediately.",B.t,null)
B.ae1=new A.d6("Global Crossmint USDC & Kenya M-PESA Thresholds:","All balances, entry fees, and prize pools are denominated in USDC. Minimum deposit is 5.00 USDC (KES 650 on M-PESA, max 2,000.00 USDC / KES 250,000 per deposit); minimum withdrawal is 5.00 USDC (KES 650 on M-PESA). Every M-PESA withdrawal carries a flat KES 50 (~0.38 USDC) Safaricom/Kopo Kopo network payout fee paid upfront (we suggest withdrawing 20.00 USDC / KES 2,600+ to keep the fixed fee impact under 2%). Optional Express VIP instant priority payout fee (KES 35 M-PESA / 0.50 USDC) applies only when explicitly selected.",B.t,null)
